flowchart LR
  Q{{"What do you need to remember?"}}
  Q -->|"a short list, up to ~15"| L["Linking chain"]
  Q -->|"a long list, a speech, steps"| P["Memory palace (loci)"]
  Q -->|"'what is item 7?'"| G["Pegs, or palace markers every 5"]
  Q -->|"a number, PIN, date"| N["Number code → words → link"]
  Q -->|"a name and a face"| F["Name → image → feature → link"]
  Q -->|"a card, a score, a pair"| C["Initials + number code → one scene"]
  Q -->|"a document or exact words"| D["Section-per-locus palace + first-letter cues"]
